    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「猿猴通人語？天兵？聽著跟話本一樣……表哥，這跟河神有關係嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Question);",
    "links": [
